  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Lionfish Inn 53 - Beach House <br>Snowbird rentals welcome <br>25+ to rent<br>No Pets or Smoking<br>Free WiFi <br>Washer & Dryer<br>2 vehicles Maximum<br>6 person golf cart included <br>Vehicles & Golf Cart must be parked on driveway<br>Beach Access <br>Tranquil-Family Friendly Neighborhood <br><br>Your stay includes $479 in daily complimentary activities! Just by booking with us, you'll receive free tickets, every day of your stay to these activities around the beach:<br>1 Free Round of Golf at Bay Point, every day!<br>1 Free Round of Golf at Windswept Dunes, every day!<br>1 Free adult admission to Shipwreck Water Park, every day!<br>1 Free adult admission on a Sunset & Dolphin watching Sailing Cruise, every day!<br>1 Free adult pass to Skywheel PCB & Mini Golf at Pier Park, every day!<br>1 Free adult admission to Wonderworks, every day!<br>1 Free pass to Just Jump Trampoline Park, every day!<br>1 Free $25 Wongo Card at Swampy Jack's Wongo Adventure, every day!<br>1 Free $20 Power Card at Dave & Buster's, once per stay!<br>One free adult admission per unit, per paid night, stay, with reservations made in advance. Reservation required. Noncumulative and nontransferable. Unused admissions expire daily. Snowbird Reservations (28 nights or longer) don't receive daily complimentary activities. <br><br>Enjoy our lovely beach house named the LIONFISH INN located in the community of Grande Pointe in Inlet Beach moments from the sugar-white sand beaches of the Gulf of Mexico in South Walton and to Lake Powell, a rare coastal dune lake. Tucked away just north of Scenic Highway 30A, this lovely decorated, 3-bedroom, 2.5 bath home has a delightful two-story floor plan with two covered porches. This is a family-oriented neighborhood, NOT A PARTY HOUSE! <br><br>As you enter, you will find 10-ft. ceilings and beautiful hardwood floors throughout the common areas with plush carpet in the bedrooms. The kitchen has granite counter-tops and stainless steel appliances including Electrolux stove and oven. The home is on a rare expansive corner lot with parking on a brick paved driveway. The bathrooms feature tile and granite with a bathtub and shower combination in the full guest bathroom and a walk-in shower in the master ensuite. The master bedroom is spacious and has exclusive access to a private covered balcony. Electric, 6-person golf cart available for guests.<br><br>THE LIVING ROOM:<br>Queen sleeper sofa, twin sleeper sofa and seating for 10<br>70' ROKU TV<br>Ceiling fan and dimmer lights<br>Painting of a Lionfish of course<br>KITCHEN:<br>Fully-stocked kitchen<br>Electrolux gas cook-top stove, wall oven and microwave<br>Stainless steel refrigerator and dishwasher<br>Electric tea kettle, Mr. Cafe coffee brewer and Keurig espresso machine<br>Large toaster, instant pot, air fryer and griddle<br>Granite counter-tops and 3 kitchen-island stools<br>DINING:<br>Dining table with seating for 8<br>1 high chair<br>MASTER BEDROOM:<br>King bed<br>ROKU TV<br>Charging stations<br>Ceiling fan<br>Bathroom with stand-up shower and 2 vanities<br>Pack n Play in master closet<br>THE OCEAN BEDROOM:<br>King bed<br>ROKU TV<br>Charging station<br>Dresser<br>Ceiling fan<br>THE BUNK BEDROOM:<br>Custom-built bunk bed with safe stairway to top bunk<br>Queen size bunk beds<br>Charging stations <br>Dresser and ROKU TV<br>Dimmable lighting<br>HALL BATHROOM:<br>Shower & tub<br>Vanity with dimmable lighting<br><br>Grande Pointe boasts a lovely neighborhood pool, clubhouse and private dock on Lake Powell. The house is located near several beach accesses; Camp Helen State Park and Hwy 98 for easy navigation. Conveniently situated near the shops and restaurants in Rosemary Beach and 30Avenue, the new pedestrian tunnel and the world-class amenities along Scenic Highway 30A, making this a perfect vacation beach house. <br>OUTDOOR AREA & AMENITIES<br>Sip after-dinner drinks from the comfort of the covered front porch and/or balcony.<br>Grande Pointe at Inlet Beach amenities include:<br>- Private community outdoor pool (7’ deep)<br>- Private dock on Lake Powell<br>- Network of nature trails around Lake Powell<br>- BBQ<br>SHED<br>- 4 Adult bikes 1 with child seat & 2 Kids bikes<br>- 4 Beach chairs & Umbrella...",
